<title>UK: BfG Hypo sets 200 million mark December 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>BfG Hypo sets 200 million mark December 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SGZ Bank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BFG HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    18.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.60    PAY DATE  S-14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 188</p>
